---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import photo from "../assets/gabriel.jpg";
import Social from "../components/Social.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About · ceifa"
  description="Gabriel Francisco, ceifa on the internet. Software developer from Belo Horizonte, Brazil."
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <section class="page-head">
      <h1><span data-land="text" id="first-perch">Hi, I'm Gabriel.</span></h1>
    </section>
    <figure class="portrait">
      <Image
        src={photo}
        alt="Gabriel smiling, in a red t-shirt."
        width={200}
        height={200}
        densities={[1, 2]}
        loading="eager"
        data-land="top"
      />
      <figcaption>Me, not the duck.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="about-body">
      <p>
        <span data-land="text"
          >I'm a software developer from Belo Horizonte, Brazil. Pretty much everywhere online I'm
          ceifa.</span
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        <span data-land="text"
          >I learned to code on Garry's Mod. I joined the community in 2014, started running servers
          in 2015 and wrote a lot of Lua for them. I never really let go of Lua or games: <a
            href="https://github.com/ceifa/wasmoon">Wasmoon</a
          > runs the real Lua VM in JavaScript and gets hundreds of thousands of downloads a month, and <a
            href="https://github.com/ceifa/steamworks.js">steamworks.js</a
          > puts Steam inside Electron games.</span
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        <span data-land="text"
          >Right now I mostly build tools for AI agents, starting with the ones I use every day. <a
            href="https://github.com/ceifa/eleven">Eleven</a
          > lets my agent answer me on Discord and Telegram, and <a href="https://agenthost.page"
            >agenthost</a
          > gives it a place to publish what it makes.</span
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        <span data-land="text"
          >I <a href="/posts">write here</a> when something doesn't fit in a tweet. Usually about programming,
          sometimes about trap music. If you want to talk, Discord is where I answer fastest.</span
        >
      </p>
      <Social class="social about-links" data-land="top" discord />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
